  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecimiento Institucional Productivo y de Gestin Fiscal Provincial</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inst Improvement Prog for Productive Sector  Fiscal Admin in Provinces</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del Programa es contribuir al fortalecimiento de los mecanismos de interaccin entre Estado Nacional y las Provincias con respecto a los sectores productivos de las provincias de menor desarrollo relativo, y en materia de gestin fiscal para el conjunto de provincias del pas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to contribute to the institutional strenghtening at provincial level, by establishing a framework of medium- and long-term fiscal and financial sustainability, maintaining an adequate fiscal balance through action on both the expenditure and the revenue sides; strengthening and upgrading the GCBA&apos; s public administration by: (i) enhancing the efficiency and transparency of its management functions, and (ii) encouraging the participation of civil society through decentralization and strengthening of the legislative body; and supporting the investment program to ensure satisfactory quality and coverage of public services.</narrative>
  </description>
